   ]
  },
  "warlock": {
   "tears the target apart from within for # sec, inflicting # shadow damage every # sec. while channeling, your siphon life, corruption, and bane of agony effects on the target deal their periodic damage #% faster. (numbers at level #; they grow with your level.)": [
    "Wrack",
    "Tears the target apart from within for 6 sec, inflicting 60.2 Shadow damage every 1 sec. While channeling, your Siphon Life, Corruption, and Bane of Agony effects on the target deal their periodic damage 100% faster. (Numbers at level 60; they grow with your level.)",
    1
   ],
   "when activated, sacrifices your summoned demon to enhance the opposing aspect of your power, granting you an effect that lasts # hours. the effect is canceled if any demon is summoned. imp: increases your shadow damage by #%. voidwalker: restores #% of your total mana every # sec. succubus/incubus: increases your fire damage by #%. felhunter: restores #% of your total health every # sec": [
    "Demonic Sacrifice",
    "When activated, sacrifices your summoned Demon to enhance the opposing aspect of your power, granting you an effect that lasts 2 hours. The effect is canceled if any Demon is summoned. Imp: Increases your Shadow damage by 15%. Voidwalker: Restores 2% of your total Mana every 4 sec. Succubus/Incubus: Increases your Fire damage by 15%. Felhunter: Restores 3% of your total Health every 4 sec.",
    1
   ],
   "your searing pain generates #% less threat and brands the target for # sec. your pet's next # attacks against the target deal # to # (scales with fire spell power and shadow spell power) fire or shadow damage based on the pet. if shadow damage is dealt, it has high threat. (numbers at level #; they grow with your level.)": [
    "Demonic Brand",
    "Your Searing Pain generates 17% less threat and brands the target for 10 sec. Your pet's next 2 attacks against the target deal 65 to 68 (scales with Fire spell power and Shadow spell power) Fire or Shadow damage based on the pet. If Shadow damage is dealt, it has high threat. (Numbers at level 60; they grow with your level.)",
    1
   ]
  },
